{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026G8aehpIXwM1794925508.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>距離聖誕節還有個幾月，尖沙咀多處已亮起聖誕燈飾。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS-2100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266mPGoyoM2A1794925517.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>尖沙咀碼頭對開商場率先以煙火迎接聖誕，戶外化身做火車站，聖誕老人會定時乘坐火車駛出。聖誕節當然少不了大型聖誕樹，配上人造飄雪，營造出濃厚的聖誕氣氛。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS-2100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WFnCusINWq1794925527.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>尖東同一晚亦有亮燈儀式，多幢建築物外牆的聖誕燈飾同步亮起，點亮夜空。警務處吉祥物「提子」亦化身聖誕鹿等角色，遍布在尖東各處。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS-2100_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vTUI3uuE6w1794925540.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS-2100_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026t3Rra4LFU91794925546.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.563971+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T15:57:26.747600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:53.094403+00:00","content_hash":"b2e6190c3bb2b530e464b550b427d049a5345d44e1544b4d0a32e0efe7de7808","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.563971+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}